---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const articles=await getCollection('articles');
const counts={Learn:articles.filter(a=>a.data.section==='Learn').length,Reference:articles.filter(a=>a.data.section==='Reference').length,Do:articles.filter(a=>a.data.section==='Do').length};
---
<Base><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div><span class="eyebrow">100% Free</span><span class="eyebrow">Vendor Neutral</span><span class="eyebrow">Open Source</span></div><h1>Understand email<br/><span>from the wire up.</span></h1><p class="lead">A technical reference for learning, building, securing, operating and troubleshooting email. From SMTP and DNS to authentication, delivery and modern security.</p><div class="topic-links"><span>Start with:</span><a href="/reference/dmarc/">DMARC</a><a href="/reference/spf/">SPF</a><a href="/reference/dkim/">DKIM</a><a href="/reference/smtp/">SMTP</a></div></div><div class="wire-card" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mail-icon">✉</div><div class="wire-line"></div><div class="protocols"><span>DNS</span><span>TLS</span><span>DMARC</span><span>SMTP</span></div></div></div></section><section class="wrap"><div class="section-intro"><p class="kicker">DOCUMENTATION + TOOLS</p><h2>Learn it. Look it up. Test it. Fix it.</h2></div><div class="grid home-grid"><a class="card" href="/learn/"><span class="card-num">01</span><h2>Learn</h2><p>Build the mental model: concepts, architecture, security, deliverability and how the pieces fit together.</p><small>{counts.Learn} guides and growing →</small></a><a class="card" href="/reference/"><span class="card-num">02</span><h2>Reference</h2><p>Look up protocols, syntax, status codes, records, standards, message structures and exact terminology.</p><small>{counts.Reference} references and growing →</small></a><a class="card" href="/do/"><span class="card-num">03</span><h2>Do</h2><p>Build, operate, secure, monitor, migrate, test and troubleshoot production email systems.</p><small>{counts.Do} procedures and growing →</small></a><a class="card" href="/tools/"><span class="card-num">04</span><h2>Tools</h2><p>Check a domain's email configuration and jump directly to the documentation that explains what was found.</p><small>Start with Domain Check →</small></a></div></section></Base>
